## 🛠️ 자동화 도구 설정

### Commitlint 설정
```javascript
// commitlint.config.js
module.exports = {
  extends: ['@commitlint/config-conventional'],
  rules: {
    'scope-enum': [2, 'always', [
      'events-api', 'campaigns', 'templates', 'users',
      'analytics', 'sendgrid', 'webhooks', 'database', 
      'auth', 'frontend', 'backend', 'infra', 'docs'
    ]],
  }
}
```

### Husky Hooks
```json
{
  "husky": {
    "hooks": {
      "commit-msg": "commitlint -E HUSKY_GIT_PARAMS",
      "pre-commit": "lint-staged"
    }
  },
  "lint-staged": {
    "*.{ts,tsx}": ["eslint --fix", "prettier --write"],
    "*.{json,md}": ["prettier --write"]
  }
}
```

